@rickiesmooth See the [comment](https://github.com/parcel-bundler/parcel/pull/7050#issuecomment-1071433977) from @101arrowz:

> you need to specify that it's a module type service worker. This behavior is [consistent with browsers](https://stackoverflow.com/a/66408379/10930232).
> 
> ```json
> "background": {
>     "service_worker": "background.ts",
>     "type": "module"
> }
> ```
